    # OFFICER @ talk "I am First Officer Borras, Captain Duprey's second in command."
    OFFICER @ talk "Je suis l'officier en second Borras, commandant en second du capitaine Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:369
translate fr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f902ebfc:

    # "I gulped as my body straightened and stiffened on its own."
    "Je déglutis alors que mon corps se redressait et se raidissait de lui-même."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:370
translate fr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b1f42af4:

