    KIARA "Kiara. Ravie de vous rencontrer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:404
translate fr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2bbabbd5:

