# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:710
translate fr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(C'... C'était un rêve !)"

